#: lib/phoenix_kit/email/core_templates.ex:204
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Hi {{user_email}},\n\nPlease confirm your account with the button below.\n\n[Confirm account]({{confirmation_url}})\n\nIf the button doesn't work, open this link: [{{confirmation_url}}]({{confirmation_url}})\n\nIf you didn't create an account with us, please ignore this email.\n"
msgstr "Tere, {{user_email}},\n\npalun kinnitage oma konto alloleva nupuga.\n\n[Kinnita konto]({{confirmation_url}})\n\nKui nupp ei tööta, avage see link: [{{confirmation_url}}]({{confirmation_url}})\n\nKui te ei loonud meie juures kontot, jätke see e-kiri tähelepanuta.\n"

#: lib/phoenix_kit/email/core_templates.ex:359
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Hi {{user_email}},\n\nSomeone has been trying to sign in to your account and failing.\n\n- Failed attempts: {{attempt_count}}\n- In the last: {{window_hours}} hour(s)\n\nNobody has signed in. You do not need to do anything if you recognize this as your own mistyped password.\n\nIf you do not, your password may be being guessed. Change it to something you do not use anywhere else:\n\n[Change password]({{security_url}})\n\nIf the button doesn't work, open this link: [{{security_url}}]({{security_url}})\n"
msgstr "Tere, {{user_email}},\n\nkeegi üritab korduvalt teie kontosse sisse logida ja ebaõnnestub.\n\n- Ebaõnnestunud katseid: {{attempt_count}}\n- Viimase: {{window_hours}} tunni jooksul\n\nKeegi ei ole sisse loginud. Kui see oli teie enda valesti sisestatud parool, ei pea te midagi tegema.\n\nKui ei olnud, võidakse teie parooli ära arvata. Vahetage see parooli vastu, mida te mujal ei kasuta:\n\n[Vaheta parool]({{security_url}})\n\nKui nupp ei tööta, avage see link: [{{security_url}}]({{security_url}})\n"

#: lib/phoenix_kit/email/core_templates.ex:264
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Hi {{user_email}},\n\nUse the button below to sign in. This link expires in 15 minutes.\n\n[Sign in]({{magic_link_url}})\n\nIf the button doesn't work, open this link: [{{magic_link_url}}]({{magic_link_url}})\n\nIf you didn't ask for this link, you can ignore this email.\n"
msgstr "Tere, {{user_email}},\n\nlogige sisse alloleva nupuga. See link aegub 15 minuti pärast.\n\n[Logi sisse]({{magic_link_url}})\n\nKui nupp ei tööta, avage see link: [{{magic_link_url}}]({{magic_link_url}})\n\nKui te seda linki ei küsinud, võite selle e-kirja tähelepanuta jätta.\n"

#: lib/phoenix_kit/email/core_templates.ex:330
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Hi {{user_email}},\n\nWe noticed a new login to your account from an unrecognized device:\n\n- Time: {{login_time}}\n- IP address: {{ip_address}}\n- Location: {{location}}\n- Device: {{browser_os}}\n\n{{failed_attempts}}\n\nIf this was you, no action is needed.\n\nIf you don't recognize this activity, secure your account:\n\n[Review account security]({{security_url}})\n\nIf the button doesn't work, open this link: [{{security_url}}]({{security_url}})\n"
msgstr "Tere, {{user_email}},\n\nmärkasime teie kontole uut sisselogimist tundmatust seadmest:\n\n- Aeg: {{login_time}}\n- IP-aadress: {{ip_address}}\n- Asukoht: {{location}}\n- Seade: {{browser_os}}\n\n{{failed_attempts}}\n\nKui see olite teie, ei ole vaja midagi teha.\n\nKui te seda tegevust ei tunne, turvake oma konto:\n\n[Kontrolli konto turvalisust]({{security_url}})\n\nKui nupp ei tööta, avage see link: [{{security_url}}]({{security_url}})\n"

#: lib/phoenix_kit/email/core_templates.ex:384
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Hi {{user_email}},\n\nWelcome to {{site_name}}! Your email address is confirmed and your account is ready.\n\n[Go to {{site_name}}]({{site_url}})\n\nIf the button doesn't work, open this link: [{{site_url}}]({{site_url}})\n"
msgstr "Tere, {{user_email}},\n\nmeil on hea meel teid näha! Teie e-posti aadress on kinnitatud ja konto on kasutamiseks valmis.\n\n[Ava {{site_name}}]({{site_url}})\n\nKui nupp ei tööta, avage see link: [{{site_url}}]({{site_url}})\n"

#: lib/phoenix_kit/email/core_templates.ex:284
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Hi {{user_email}},\n\nWelcome! To complete your registration, use the button below.\n\n[Complete registration]({{registration_url}})\n\nIf the button doesn't work, open this link: [{{registration_url}}]({{registration_url}})\n\nThis link will expire in 30 minutes for your security.\n\nIf you didn't request this registration, please ignore this email.\n"
msgstr "Tere, {{user_email}},\n\nmeil on hea meel, et liitute! Registreerimise lõpetamiseks kasutage allolevat nuppu.\n\n[Lõpeta registreerimine]({{registration_url}})\n\nKui nupp ei tööta, avage see link: [{{registration_url}}]({{registration_url}})\n\nTeie turvalisuse huvides aegub see link 30 minuti pärast.\n\nKui te seda registreerimist ei taotlenud, jätke see e-kiri tähelepanuta.\n"

#: lib/phoenix_kit/email/core_templates.ex:244
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Hi {{user_email}},\n\nYou can change your email with the button below.\n\n[Confirm email change]({{update_url}})\n\nIf the button doesn't work, open this link: [{{update_url}}]({{update_url}})\n\nIf you didn't request this change, please ignore this email.\n"
msgstr "Tere, {{user_email}},\n\nsaate oma e-posti aadressi muuta alloleva nupuga.\n\n[Kinnita e-posti aadressi muutmine]({{update_url}})\n\nKui nupp ei tööta, avage see link: [{{update_url}}]({{update_url}})\n\nKui te seda muudatust ei taotlenud, jätke see e-kiri tähelepanuta.\n"

#: lib/phoenix_kit/email/core_templates.ex:224
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Hi {{user_email}},\n\nYou can reset your password with the button below.\n\n[Reset password]({{reset_url}})\n\nIf the button doesn't work, open this link: [{{reset_url}}]({{reset_url}})\n\nIf you didn't request this change, please ignore this email.\n"
